ind":"announcement","title":"MUSTER Devblog: More Ways to Break a Crowd","summary":"A group of enemies closing in should feel different depending on who's standing in their way. A Rogue might answer with a fan of blades. A Mage might turn the ground beneath them into an eruption of fire. A Warrior might split the formation straight down the middle. We've been adding more area-of-effect attacks to MUSTER, along with animations that help each one feel like part of its class. Here's a look at four new optional talent attacks, plus some work on making the buildup to bigger moments ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:09:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029701","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:55:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127720-1844115010505195","game_id":"steam-5127720","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo - REWORKED","summary":"We’ve been reworking the MUSTER demo around one question: how do we give you a feel for what a warband can become within a single expedition?The new flow brings together a short playable introduction, a guided look at camp, and three prepared warbands that show different stages of progression. Then you take your chosen company through six floors of the Barrow to its final boss.One practice board. Three starting warbands. Six floors to put your choices to the test. We want the first few minutes t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T19:01:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505195","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127720-1844115010497468","game_id":"steam-5127720","kind":"announcement","title":"MUSTER Devblog: The Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"The free MUSTER demo is now available on Steam for Windows, macOS, and Linux! We've spent the last few devblogs talking about how MUSTER has been taking shape: the talent system, the evolving battlefields, the equipment, and the pixel art that brings it all together. Now you can get your hands on those ideas and see how they feel in an expedition. Download the demo from the MUSTER Steam page and look for the demo download button. For our small two-person team, this is a big milestone. There's a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T16:37:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127720-1844115010489601","game_id":"steam-5127720","kind":"announcement","title":"MUSTER Devblog: From Pixels to Spritesheets with PixelWall","summary":"MUSTER is still in development, and a lot of its personality lives in very small images: a talent icon, a flickering flame, or a creature that needs to read clearly on a crowded battlefield. The game's art combines licensed assets with original work. For this devblog, we wanted to share how we've been using PixelWall to build our own pixel art, organize spritesheets, and bring animation into the game. Start with something you can read Working at a small size makes every pixel count. A silhouette","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T16:16:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489601","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127720-1844115010489566","game_id":"steam-5127720","kind":"announcement","title":"MUSTER Devblog: From Stat Upgrades to Build Choices","summary":"MUSTER is still in development, and the things you find underground have changed a lot along the way. Our early loot system was a small collection of named weapons and charms. Since then, we've been working toward items that give you reasons to rethink a hero's kit, your formation, or the direction of a run. Here's how we got from that first handful of items to the system we're building now. Starting with a pick and a charm The first equipment catalogue had sixteen items. A Rusted Pick added pow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T16:04:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127720-1844115010489508","game_id":"steam-5127720","kind":"announcement","title":"MUSTER Devblog: From Flat Battlefields to Free Camera Control","summary":"MUSTER is still in development, and our battlefields have already been through a few different lives. They began as a flat 2D board, grew into an isometric space, and eventually became something you could rotate and tilt to find your own view of the fight. For an autobattler, the battlefield does a lot of the explaining. You arrange your warband and watch the plan play out. The view needs to help you understand who is fighting, where they can move, and why your formation worked—or fell apart. He","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T15:46:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127720-1844115010489454","game_id":"steam-5127720","kind":"announcement","title":"MUSTER Devblog: Making Talents Easier to Understand","summary":"MUSTER is still in development, and we wanted to share a closer look at one of the things we've been working on: making talents easier to get into while keeping room to experiment. We like a big talent tree. Following connections, finding a useful combination, and imagining what a hero could become are a big part of the appeal. MUSTER has 20 classes, each with three talent paths, so there is plenty to explore. But that also creates a problem. Every new hero brings another set of choices to under","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T15:28:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489454","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5127720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5127720":"2026-10-26T08:43:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5127720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:35Z"},"5230460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:36Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5127720","app_id":5127720,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"db63763d6bad74fe87db998ba2da7acf23bb2e2ecc19a45c17091fb218761865","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A roguelite autobattler where every dig shapes your next fight. Build, equip, and position a five-digger warband from twenty different characters, then watch your plan play out 